        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A beginner yellow shooting star made from a small sphere centre and five cone points. A looped yarn tail of three or four strands trails from one point to suggest motion. The points sew onto the centre at evenly spaced angles."
