        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Divide the centre into five evenly spaced attachment points. Sew one point at each position. Cut four lengths of yellow yarn, fold in half, and loop through one back point to create the shooting tail. Knot and trim to 8 cm."
